# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the SHIP-3 gates (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of
# tp4/ship-3 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Templates only: no tag is pushed from the
# branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the pass rule. ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-3 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed commit
# (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-3/<tag>/' *.env). The ship profile and its approved waiver are the ship pack's, byte for byte. Nothing here stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# TC (STOP): a SHORT smoke of the ship profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic on the SHIP-3 image: a warmup, a coding answer, the non-streaming
# tool_call test, the two STREAMED parser tests (stream_tool_call: tool_calls deltas with a JSON call and no <tool_call> marker in the content; stream_reasoning) and
# nothing else. The smoke ends red only by the concurrent8_steady list rule (C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL names the omission). READ (c2_smoke_check, every rule clean, including the
# fusion rule toolcall_whitespace_smoke from scripts/ci/fusion-wp/TW.json): the container log holds 'toolcall whitespace: armed' and 'toolcall whitespace: installed on' (a
# 'disabled' line fails it), the profile's own engaged lines are the ship pack's, tool_call, stream_tool_call and stream_reasoning pass, the ship profile boots on 13x10 as
# in the ship pack. WHAT IT DOES NOT PROVE: neither tool-call test asks the model for an argument with edge whitespace (what the model writes is its own), so the byte-level
# proof is the CPU test against the real parsers (test_c2_toolcall_whitespace: the stock parser strips, the fixed one keeps, render, parse, render is the identity), run in
# CI and in the image build; this job proves the fix is live in the server that took the requests and that tool calls still arrive intact. No telemetry sidecar (a short
# functional smoke). Estimate 20 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-3
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,tool_call,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=tool-call smoke: its test list is fixed by the protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
C2_BOX_MINUTES=40
